  "seed": "At Next defaults, no flag set: the sample recording on V1 and the sample music under it on its own track. A range drawn on the ruler from 0:03 to 0:06 stays in hand when the music is clicked: the wash stays over the clips, the music is picked as well, and a right click on the music inside the range leads with what the range does to it. Mute Section silences the music between 0:03 and 0:06 and nowhere else, measured in the mix, as one step to undo. The same goes for an Option-drag range on the music's track alone: a click on the music keeps it, Delete takes the music's part of it and leaves the gap, and Escape lets the range go before the pick.",
